node_warnings.description:
The node reports:

{warnings}

`unseenet-monitor` in the add-on shows more. This goes away by itself when the node is well again.

replica_twin.description:
Something else posts with this replica's key - most likely a copy of it running on another machine, such as a restored backup. Two replicas with one key can split the council, so this one signs nothing until you act.

The post it did not send: {subject}

Stop the other copy. When it is gone, run `unseenet-replica twin-gone {message_id}` in the add-on.

replica_held.description:
These council changes wait until you agree:

{changes}

Run `unseenet-replica status` in the add-on for what they are, and `unseenet-replica agree LABEL` to let one go ahead.
